.git
.github
.turbo
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
*.log
pnpm-debug.log*

# Local env files must never leak into a build. Next.js auto-loads
# apps/web/.env.local at `next build` time, which previously baked dev ports
# (e.g. :17721) into the image. Compose passes runtime env via --env-file, so
# build contexts never need these.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
!.env.dogfood.example
